# Task train_13: the run is acceptable if at least one of two plans is
# completed. Plan one: visit A and then, at a strictly later step, visit
# B, while never entering the hazard zone X. Plan two: visit the overflow
# dock D at least once. Completing both plans is allowed.
or(
    and(
        order(A, B),
        avoid(X)
    ),
    visit(D)
)
